The '''Dunes of Contemplation'''<ref name="THR5" /> were located on the [[moon]] [[Jedha]]. A statue of a [[Jedi]]<ref name="Unity" /> known as the [[Final Protector]] was located in the Dunes of Contemplation.<ref name="THR5" />

